From b063d15feb28828908d3d511ca517390caf5fb4c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex Unleashed <codex-unleashed@holdmyspot.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 00:20:42 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Route public daemon updates to Codex Unleashed releases

Keep the public stable menu text and update lifecycle. Fetch installers and packages exclusively from holdmyspot-com/codex-unleashed, validate numbered vendor versions, and preserve pins and failure recovery.

TDD against rust-v0.160.0 a956835d020762cb2b570053af06f643a11c0ecc: Python installer tests first failed at OpenAI request URLs and rejection of 0.160.0+39; just test -p codex-app-server-daemon -E "test(installer_fetch_uses_exact_url)" failed at the OpenAI installer URL; vendor eligibility and package seed tests failed at missing latest-channel eligibility. Green: Python installer suite 12 passed; PowerShell release-selection check passed (pristine upstream rejects vendor version); just test -p codex-app-server-daemon 69 passed. The Cargo command regenerates upstream local package versions in Cargo.lock; no dependency change is carried.
